# 6) How you generate the QR token + wire into your QR tile

* You create a `spinTokens/{tokenId}` doc (admin-only UI action) with:

  * `screenId`, `campaignId`, `expiresAt`
* Then set your QR tile’s `dataUrl` to:

  * `https://app.accelrestaurants.com/spin?o={orgId}&t={tokenId}`

**Security note:** Tokens are not readable from clients, so even if someone tries to guess token IDs, it won’t help without the server validating them.

